uation of the ellipse is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{(x-h)^{2}}{{a}^{2}}+\\frac{(y-k)^{2}}{{b}^{2}} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{{2}^{2}}+\\frac{(y-4)^{2}}{{4}^{2}} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{4}+\\frac{(y-4)^{2}}{16} & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535022 true] [17592186327335 1000 #edb/ref 17592186327336 13194139535022 true] [17592186327335 1000 #edb/ref 17592186327337 13194139535022 true] [17592186327335 1000 #edb/ref 17592186327338 13194139535022 true] [17592186327335 1000 #edb/ref 17592186327339 13194139535022 true] [17592186327335 1000 #edb/ref 17592186327340 13194139535022 true] [17592186327335 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535022 true] [17592186327335 1041 "selection" 13194139535022 true] [17592186327335 1104 #edb/ref 17592186327337 13194139535022 true] [17592186327335 1110 #uuid "d0562518-004f-5f3f-88fe-c6bb0947eace" 13194139535022 true] [17592186327336 1034 "\\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{2}+\\frac{(y-4)^{2}}{4}=1" 13194139535022 true] [17592186327336 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535022 true] [17592186327336 1111 #uuid "ee626abc-6596-5788-8c21-712d77893dc6" 13194139535022 true] [17592186327337 1034 "\\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{4}+\\frac{(y-4)^{2}}{16}=1" 13194139535022 true] [17592186327337 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535022 true] [17592186327337 1111 #uuid "9ad3dd6d-ffa1-5573-8019-cf0c2c7ce21c" 13194139535022 true] [17592186327338 1034 "\\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{16}+\\frac{(y-4)^{2}}{4}=1" 13194139535022 true] [17592186327338 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535022 true] [17592186327338 1111 #uuid "fc5a24c5-7fda-5555-990e-858e8a177338" 13194139535022 true] [17592186327339 1034 "\\frac{(x+4)^{2}}{4}+\\frac{(y+2)^{2}}{16}=1" 13194139535022 true] [17592186327339 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535022 true] [17592186327339 1111 #uuid "c690cc91-8fdf-5bd4-b6da-b259ed879530" 13194139535022 true] [17592186327340 1034 "\\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{4}+\\frac{(y-4)^{2}}{8}=1" 13194139535022 true] [17592186327340 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535022 true] [1759218632